  If you use SynthBO, cite this software version and the original research
  methods actually used. See docs/HOW_TO_CITE.md and REFERENCES.bib.
title: "SynthBO: local desktop experiment planning for chemists"
authors:
  - name: "SynthBO contributors"
version: "0.2.5"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/wei-rui499/SynthBO"
