abstract: >-
  An independent desktop interface integrating existing scientific optimization
  methods with local data entry, executable recipe domains, diagnostics,
  visualization, and native packaging. Third-party methods and software retain
  their original authorship and licenses. This citation does not replace
  citations to the algorithms actually used.
keywords:
  - chemistry
  - Bayesian optimization
  - experiment planning
  - desktop software
